; rpg-stream.b6 -- guest stubs used by run-rpg.py.
;
; 077700: emit one UK byte on PL1 through УВВ 0171 (the real RPG
; channel), then stop.  The runner deposits the byte into ACC with
; `d ACC`, sets PC with `d PC 077700` and continues with `go`.  SIMH's
; `run` command would reset the machine and clear ACC, so `go` is used.
;
; 077720: unconditional branch pair.  After a byte is punched, PL
; clears READY2 for 12.5 ms of simulated time.  The runner points PC
; here and executes `step N` so that simulated time advances and
; pl_event() reasserts READY2 before the next byte.  No GP device is
; involved.
;
; Both areas are free in the booted DISPAK image (see gp-fig-handler).

в 077700
к увв 171, стоп

в 077720
к пб 077720, пб 077720
